5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to help with the park. I want to make sure we can actually build it on time, so I'll check the earth-moving tenders and the depot phasing notes!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A pleasure to be here. I suspect the park's actual usage and the climate will dictate its success. I shall examine the weekday crossing counts and the drainage callouts.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,Hello. I'm curious about who will take care of the plants and paths every day. I'll look at the groundskeeping roll and the volunteer groups.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,I believe we should look at the reality of past projects. I will examine the condition of works from the earlier programme and the record of the eastern avenue planting.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. To understand the long-term burden on the city, I shall look into the upkeep ledger spend and the regional habitat fund terms.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
